# 🤖 AI Chatbot using Python, Streamlit & Groq

A web-based AI chatbot built with Python and Streamlit, using the Groq API to generate AI responses.

The project provides a simple conversational interface where users can interact with an AI assistant directly from a web browser.



## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how Python can be used to build and deploy an AI-powered web application.

The application uses:

- Python for the chatbot logic
- Groq API for AI-generated responses
- Streamlit for the web interface
- Session state for conversation memory
- Environment variables for securely storing the API key
- Markdown rendering for formatted AI responses

The project is designed as a practical Python project and can be extended with features such as authentication, databases, caching, guardrails, and deployment.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🤖 AI Chatbot

Users can communicate with an AI assistant through a simple chat interface.

### 💬 Conversation Memory

The chatbot maintains the current conversation using Streamlit session state.

Each active user session has its own conversation history.

### ⚡ Streaming Responses

The Groq API is used with streaming enabled so that responses can be displayed progressively instead of waiting for the entire response before showing it.

### 📝 Markdown Formatting

AI responses can contain:

- Bold text
- Headings
- Bullet points
- Numbered lists
- Code blocks
- Tables
- Inline code

Streamlit renders the Markdown response in a readable format.

### 🔐 Environment Variables

The Groq API key is stored in a `.env` file instead of being written directly in the Python source code.

The `.env` file is excluded from Git using `.gitignore`.

### 🌐 Web Interface

Streamlit provides the complete browser-based user interface without requiring a separate frontend framework.

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology    | Purpose                                                    |
| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Python        | Application and chatbot logic                              |
| Streamlit     | Web application interface                                  |
| Groq API      | AI/LLM response generation                                 |
| python-dotenv | Loading environment variables                              |
| JSON          | Local data handling in the original chatbot implementation |
| Git & GitHub  | Version control and project hosting                        |

